    <strong>Writing</strong>
    <p>Working on my first novel, a work of speculative Christian fiction. I am currently working through John Truby’s book <i>The Anatomy of Story</i>.</p>

    <strong>Reading</strong>
    <p>Reading my first murder mystery: <i>And Then There Were None</i> by Agatha Christie.</p>

    <strong>Living</strong>
    <p>Based in Waxahachie, Texas (just south of Dallas). I am currently focused on building the daily habit of journaling, reading fiction, and writing every day.</p>

    <strong>Listening</strong>
    <p>Listening to <a href="http://www.youtube.com/@ledger5517">Ledger</a>. A recent <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X0ZHedQc0Fs">interview</a> made me understand why I resonate with her songs; her determination to not let anxiety hold her down.</p>
    <strong>Mindset</strong>
    <p>I don't know where this path will lead yet.  The struggle to begin writing is real.  I'm a little bit convinced that you have to be a little bit insane to want to write a novel and yet here I am...</p>
